			"text": "# Dream\nan endless black velvet void, drifting silk ribbons of shadow, a single cold silver light, surreal and seductive\n\nRight-click a recipe card to make its art; it saves into `screens/dream/art/`. Then place it on [[World.canvas]] in the `dream` group."
